  "body": "Absolutely No Agent contact please! \r\nPlease note; Private Sale with settlement to suit. \r\nNo Exterior signage posted. \r\nPlease contact by phone on 027 273 1444 \r\nAn outstanding warm home for sale by solo owner on a 624m2 section with part tree covered easy bank offering seclusion and low maintenance. \r\n2023 GJ Gardner build with balance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\nFully fenced, freehold 624sqm site - no body corporate fees\r\nNo Smoking or pets home.\r\nMany surprises here, too many value added up spec'd extra's to list here such as all hard floors (Tiles) heatable, electric  water heating (no Gas, no fee's) with recirculation pump so almost no waiting for hot water to arrive (4 cold liters later)  and an Induction cook top etc.\r\nLoads of storage and heaps of room for your kids, dog's, chicken's whatever that few other units in this development have, such as an extra outdoor family and entertaining area. (Sit in the Spa and watch TV, included in sale with conditions)\r\nA Tandem garage for 2 average sized cars or 1 car plus office/study (which could be isolated into another bedroom) and 1 car park outside.\r\nLaundry with Wc included and is on the ground floor.\r\nNote; Fly around and Street view is not the correct buildings! \r\n \r\nIf you are looking for something better, with many extra's of high quality that will tick all your boxes then come have a look. (List of extra's available on request at viewing).\r\nThis really is a private an awesome place to live in.\r\nPlease phone for NO OBLIGATION genuine interest and viewing. Feel free to make an offer.\r\nAgain, no Agents.\r\nThank you.",
